[{"title":"午日西溪宴集歌","author":"孙传庭","text":"五月五日霁色鲜，西溪开宴罗群贤。\n薰风微动水清涟，宝树琼枝纷四筵。\n王郎善谑至独先，往往令人发狂颠。\n雄饮真如吸巨川，髯张意兴凌青毡。\n挥麈能谭秋水篇，曹生雅是青门传。\n畏饮却知听管弦，窦叔愿者亦复然。\n刘家兄弟殊翩翩，伯仲叔季华萼联。\n阿侄文采独披宣，太学冯君任侠偏。\n一掷能轻百万钱，弟充落魄爱逃禅。\n两郎词坛何蹁跹，元三时花美女妍。\n令我一见心诚怜，元瑞奇古薄丹铅。\n欲夺苏韩印独专，相马常思九方歅。\n犹子修隐文行全，朝舞莱衣夕韦编。\n宸居早著祖逖鞭，群季俊秀皆惠连。\n独有六古堪比肩，余家大阮尽招延。\n新叔扬州跨鹤还，不贪腰无十万缠。\n纶叔脩饬自娟娟，吉叔临池笔如椽。\n常来醉倒习池边，健叔绝伎擅鸣弦。\n时向新丰酒家眠，德叔尤喜酒如泉。\n经叔□□美且鬈，瑞儿才知放纸鸢。\n相与调笑弄潺湲，亲知骨肉相周旋。\n固知此乐属性天，况复良辰美景骈。\n少长杂列不问年，登高临水随其便。\n主宾迭进摇画船，夹岸歌儿唱采莲。\n鸣筝挝鼓声阗阗，柳外新月一钩穿。\n长去少留素手牵，更纵兰桡破暝烟。\n一曲沧浪意欲仙，曾闻沧海变桑田。\n金谷兰亭久弃捐，及时我辈毋拘挛。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24359,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳莲篇寿田御宿大参","author":"孙传庭","text":"我闻华岳之顶，池生千叶莲。\n采而服之成神仙，华岳之名以此传。\n雁门使君神仙者，自幼生长华岳下。\n早探玉版嚼金丹，驾鹿骑龙如走马。\n使君咄咄薄霞举，挥手山中谢毛女。\n徜徉陆地漫浮沉，冥搜时共岳灵语。\n岳灵使君相下上，烁烁莲花开五脏。\n落腕雄文擘巨灵，山鬼叫号混沌丧。\n一日声名动帝闉，夷然束带向风尘。\n凫舄蹁跹聊玩世，骢马腾骧亦避人。\n骢马春明不可留，玉节雄藩领上游。\n才向匡庐观瀑布，忽依勾注揽斗牛。\n勾注烟云接五峰，文殊见后多遐踪。\n遍地平铺金菡萏，倚天高插翠芙蓉。\n使君静对意何有，紫塞烟销靖刁斗。\n扫榻焚香诗思幽，欲唤太华共杯酒。\n每来访我荷池边，如临玉井意嫣然。\n为言十丈花开处，使我两腋同飞仙。\n仲夏六月荷英鲜，恰逢使君开寿筵。\n我有白云不堪赠，特为赋此岳莲篇。\n惟愿使君如莲还如岳，赤英倾日绿阴稠，千秋万载标卓荦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24360,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜独坐","author":"孙传庭","text":"独坐南窗月，悠然欲二更。\n空庭疏雨歇，小苑淡烟横。\n湖海怜多病，乾坤苦用兵。\n旁皇清不寐，倚剑看欃枪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24361,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春晦夕偶张屏灯同武子饮分韵得来字","author":"孙传庭","text":"为惜春宵尽，纱屏四面开。\n影摇花欲动，光满月疑来。\n客共飞觞兴，人称入洛才。\n稍闻烽火息，潦倒醉金罍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24362,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别武子 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"戎马愁方剧，那堪送远人。\n看云怜别苦，折柳问归频。\n宦况惟余拙，交情独尔真。\n明年十日酒，同对帝城春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24363,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别武子 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"痛饮真吾事，其如别恨何。\n风尘劳岁月，湖海尚干戈。\n病骨开樽懒，雄心倚剑多。\n萧萧涟水上，千古此悲歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24364,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同梁大煦工部饮王宜苏吏部园亭 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"城市开佳胜，登临拟辋川。\n莓苔新著雨，竹树晚含烟。\n水部才谁似，山公兴独偏。\n何当逃吏事，长此共留连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24365,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同梁大煦工部饮王宜苏吏部园亭 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"莫话风尘事，相怜但酒卮。\n挑灯花转艳，倚槛月初垂。\n衫履追随雅，天涯聚晤奇。\n独怜烽火急，重醉定何期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24366,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"孙传庭","text":"经年长作客，独夜况逢秋。\n烛影摇乡思，砧声乱旅愁。\n梦随鸿北下，心逐火西流。\n山月今方好，安能载酒酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24367,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夜 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"边塞家何处，天涯岁又除。\n乡心三载剧，客况此宵馀。\n看剑心弥壮，谋糈计转疏。\n明朝三十一，独坐叹居诸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24368,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夜 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"柏酒堪成醉，其如感慨何。\n风前人一别，客里岁三过。\n鸿雁关河远，烽烟道路多。\n坐深聊假寐，清梦绕烟萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24369,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日试笔用除夜韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"岁从今日首，腊自昨宵除。\n郡邑惊危后，乾坤战伐馀。\n物华人自竞，世局我全疏。\n何似悠悠者，渔樵老孟诸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24370,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春郊","author":"孙传庭","text":"蹑履郊西路，怆然思有馀。\n轻云飏远岫，新水湛平湖。\n别恨萦春柳，新愁长绿芜。\n不堪成独啸，征雁一声孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24371,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野宿","author":"孙传庭","text":"烛影孤村夜，星光独宿楼。\n愁随春野阔，梦逐故山浮。\n倚枕怜多病，持杯笑浪游。\n何时归计得，啸咏绕烟洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24372,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"火树 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"不借东风力，还因劫火新。\n联翻天不夜，乱落地皆春。\n片片霞光幻，枝枝宝色匀。\n谁云花顷刻，人世总非真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24373,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"火树 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"煖艳围红玉，偏宜月下逢。\n辉煌侵夜色，雕镂失天工。\n长养非关雨，飘零岂待风。\n莫疑枝叶异，玉树本青葱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24374,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"火树 其三","author":"孙传庭","text":"疑是乘春气，瑩瑩万朵繁。\n楼台灵蜃现，庭院烛龙翻。\n士女喧良夜，笙歌满上元。\n漫矜饶艳丽，桃李本无言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24375,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庞云涛孝廉至留酌衙斋用韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"词坛久寂寞，割据尚吾曹。\n把酒分花气，论文落翠涛。\n余才原僻傲，汝意故粗豪。\n千古存深寄，萧疏在二毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24376,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春云","author":"孙传庭","text":"春云如有意，片片下城闉。\n乍合遥天媚，俄开远岫新。\n有情元是幻，浮世总非真。\n晚景苍茫色，攸然得所亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24377,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酒筹","author":"孙传庭","text":"共觅清宵醉，消磨付酒筹。\n参差分夜月，来往促春瓯。\n爱客宜苛令，撩人喜暗投。\n漫言探海屋，此饮足千秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24378,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨","author":"孙传庭","text":"已叹遗黎尽，谁驱旱厉回。\n一年才见雨，五月始闻雷。\n父老扶藜出，儿童跨犊来。\n欣然如有告，具烬不须哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24379,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨","author":"孙传庭","text":"蝗旱愁初歇，重怜雨不休。\n田庐翻作沼，阛阓可乘舟。\n索饷追呼急，徵兵羽檄稠。\n萧条四野内，不忍豁双眸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24380,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闱中夜集用李捖阳扇头韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"棘院初鸣柝，绣衣晚散衙。\n萍分俱是客，星聚即为家。\n醉倚床头月，狂生笔底花。\n漏深香气湿，知己落霜华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24381,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同陈玉铉张雨苍小集","author":"孙传庭","text":"两君天下士，与我一乡人。\n轰耳才名重，论心臭味真。\n雌雄惊剑合，慷慨觉情亲。\n咫尺联青琐，何劳叹积薪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24382,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与许亦龄诸丈夜集","author":"孙传庭","text":"知己当今夕，何妨漏几催。\n纵谭灯渐短，剧饮月初来。\n萧索同官况，悲歌总赋才。\n西楼漫寥落，归雁几声哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24383,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月七日署中小酌","author":"孙传庭","text":"小院惊秋老，天涯忽二霜。\n干戈连五月，风雨近重阳。\n作赋惟乡思，当歌任酒狂。\n巡檐频感事，丛菊为谁黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24384,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伍家集早发","author":"孙传庭","text":"荒村夜不寐，明发揽征衣。\n残月沉高树，疏星照短帷。\n鸡声催晓乱，暝色入晨微。\n渐觉春寒薄，东林日欲晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24385,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜","author":"孙传庭","text":"官署饶幽况，含毫对酒垆。\n春星临晓树，夜色满平芜。\n兴剧呼明月，诗成质老奴。\n盘桓不成寐，清坐未言孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24386,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雨次萧武子韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"清署偏宜雨，当垆饮兴增。\n竹窗香雾合，草径晚烟凝。\n酒剧苍头妒，诗豪白眼憎。\n狂来无著处，却忆六朝僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24387,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐次武子韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"无计堪消暑，偏宜趁晚凉。\n都将愁付酒，不为病修方。\n揽鬓怜余短，论心爱女长。\n赋成聊共质，如觉齿牙香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24388,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"携樽饮胡汉涵民部于杨氏园 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"爱客晚携樽，开门月满园。\n春花初倚槛，翠竹故当轩。\n画栋歌声绕，绮筵舞袖翻。\n怜君归思切，执手欲消魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24389,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"携樽饮胡汉涵民部于杨氏园 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"飞觞同醉月，乘兴复登楼。\n梁苑闻新曲，并州忆旧游。\n深谈时屏御，久坐数添筹。\n为问芒山气，今仍似昔浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24390,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自大梁还署中小酌即事","author":"孙传庭","text":"燕邸人方至，梁园客亦还。\n烟尘频怅望，樽酒暂开颜。\n草长空阶寂，花开小苑閒。\n征途新得句，搦管共君删。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24391,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷亭饮丁竟豪宪副次韵 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"负郭成溪隐，閒情合洒然。\n学耕时省稼，试钓或临渊。\n碧柳垂门外，青山绕座前。\n偶延双盖入，光采照池莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24392,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷亭饮丁竟豪宪副次韵 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"小筑南洲迥，鸣驺喜贲然。\n芰荷迎剑佩，箫鼓振林渊。\n酒继平原后，诗追大历前。\n使君饶藻逸，伯仲见青莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24393,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"辟地开三径，诛茅搆一椽。\n藜羹堪饱食，竹簟任高眠。\n夹岸千株柳，环溪百亩田。\n今年穑事好，足了酒家钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24394,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"窥园时纵履，随地得悠然。\n曲涧双桥转，危崖一径穿。\n摘蔬遴嫩菌，试茗汲新泉。\n憩荫垂杨下，飘飘意欲仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24395,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居 其三","author":"孙传庭","text":"迂僻真成性，终朝静掩门。\n就中微有会，此外复何言。\n种得花千树，沽来酒一樽。\n自非庭畔鹤，不许破苔痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24396,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居 其四","author":"孙传庭","text":"不是耽元寂，吾生合隐沦。\n烟霞支病骨，山水爱閒身。\n草阁全无暑，花田别有春。\n祗应成独往，鱼鸟却相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24397,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居 其五","author":"孙传庭","text":"浮名吾自厌，岂与世相违。\n远岫孤云没，空林一鸟归。\n屠龙心漫切，刻鹄事全非。\n终计惟深隐，西山蕨正肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24398,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居 其六","author":"孙传庭","text":"清事吾犹懒，况于俗事关。\n亭空惟贮月，案静独延山。\n作赋羞雕棘，敲棋厌角蛮。\n评花与选石，尚谓碍馀閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24399,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居 其七","author":"孙传庭","text":"交游近冷落，吾亦拙逢迎。\n山色当门古，溪光拂座清。\n平畴开远眺，曲径引閒行。\n老此无馀羡，堪同鹿豕盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24400,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居 其八","author":"孙传庭","text":"离骚原夙好，斋坐探深幽。\n哀怨悲今古，文章第一流。\n高才多放逐，浊世合夷犹。\n读罢馀深感，床头酒满瓯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24401,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏小憩映碧园","author":"孙传庭","text":"小憩山园静，清和四月天。\n柳飞琼玉乱，荷散碧钱圆。\n腊酒邻翁送，芽茶稚子煎。\n声声布谷鸟，惊破午窗眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24402,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西溪舟泛 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"曲水饶幽况，閒情寄小艟。\n杯邀杨柳月，裾引芰荷风。\n兰社人同载，桃源路可通。\n却怜尘世上，劳苦叹飘蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24403,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西溪舟泛 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"小泛西溪上，悠然自在流。\n吾原应纵壑，仆故解操舟。\n短棹随花发，轻帆共月浮。\n忽疑多事客，击楫欲何求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24404,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西溪舟泛 其三","author":"孙传庭","text":"三尺平塘水，居然可放舟。\n新荷迎客艳，细柳拂堤柔。\n江海双泡落，乾坤一叶浮。\n烟波如有意，即此是沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24405,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西溪舟泛 其四","author":"孙传庭","text":"星汉仙槎杳，扁舟乐意关。\n自能专一壑，何用访三山。\n万事无过酒，浮名好是閒。\n渔鸥堪作侣，竟日每忘还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24406,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热屏烛","author":"孙传庭","text":"辟暑偏宜夜，帷灯觉可憎。\n人疑居火宅，吾欲踏层冰。\n乍可华樽暗，从教堆案仍。\n呼童亟屏去，照胆有良朋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24407,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园侣","author":"孙传庭","text":"园居谁是伴，鹿豕总堪群。\n绕槛皆予美，环池有此君。\n松阴邀鹤共，莲沼与鸥分。\n相对不相厌，朝霞共夕曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24408,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园课","author":"孙传庭","text":"园居有密课，早起向前除。\n花径随风扫，药畦趁雨锄。\n閒临鹅换帖，闷检蠹留书。\n琴画兼诗赋，萧然雅兴馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24409,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涵虚阁四咏 其一 流觞","author":"孙传庭","text":"流觞溪水曲，杂坐列群仙。\n筹借新花作，杯凭细浪传。\n飞扬尘外客，潇洒镜中天。\n远忆兰亭迹，山阴脩褉年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24410,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涵虚阁四咏 其二 听泉","author":"孙传庭","text":"众籁溪边寂，泉声枕上通。\n急来知带雨，远至想随风。\n宛转危桥下，清凄乱石中。\n拂琴聊一曲，流水调堪同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24411,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涵虚阁四咏 其三 泛月","author":"孙传庭","text":"兰桡侵晚荡，桂影逐人来。\n舟似珠盘转，溪如镜匣开。\n映波霜欲立，浮濑雪为堆。\n还视涵虚阁，依稀逼玉台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24412,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西园偶成","author":"孙传庭","text":"世情总如此，吾意复何求。\n负郭山连水，为园近且幽。\n朝来黄鸟唤，晚驻白云留。\n因忆陶彭泽，居然达者流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24413,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏松塔二首和田御宿焦涵一作 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"浮图耽夙寄，对此意殊饶。\n细叶攒峰削，高柯累级遥。\n沸涛仙梵落，掩盖宝幢摇。\n舍利应曾贮，君无讶后凋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24414,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏松塔二首和田御宿焦涵一作 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"别有团栾致，亭亭倚盖齐。\n疑抟冰雪造，喜引茑萝跻。\n干直知为柱，枝垂想作梯。\n盘桓神骨爽，髣髴过招提。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24415,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田太液将军请告西归赋赠","author":"孙传庭","text":"君归元自好，吾意惜君归。\n四海妖氛剧，三边将略微。\n请缨心正切，投笔愿何违。\n麟阁方虚左，宁应问钓矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24416,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"尽日崎岖路，登跻意自閒。\n云深时有寺，树密若无山。\n怪石崚嶒见，奇峰曲折攀。\n何当归隐地，长此隔人寰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24417,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"行处山俱好，何妨任意游。\n草间横乱石，树杪落寒流。\n古洞晴如雨，阴崖夏亦秋。\n尽知延胜赏，随地有高楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24418,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行 其三","author":"孙传庭","text":"惟恐行将尽，行来境益偏。\n石林披雾入，翠壁扪萝穿。\n径转全无路，峰回别有天。\n渐看日欲暮，爱此且停鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24419,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行 其四","author":"孙传庭","text":"不识五峰路，真游杳霭间。\n回岩行欲住，曲径往疑还。\n惜马知僮健，寻僧信客閒。\n翠微如见许，投老键柴关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24420,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峨谷","author":"孙传庭","text":"五峰知不远，峨谷亦殊佳。\n水绕明珠曲，山排翠髻丫。\n岚光衔古寺，树色吐村家。\n岩畔寻高隐，忻分羽士茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24421,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清凉石与王永泰对奕","author":"孙传庭","text":"欲證三乘妙，非争一局强。\n山中人自静，石上日偏长。\n子夺琉璃色，枰分薝卜香。\n岂同赌墅客，定不碍清凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24422,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秘魔岩 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"夙慕灵岩胜，扶筇共客探。\n危崖悬佛宇，峭壁嵌僧龛。\n鹤舞高松健，龙眠古洞酣。\n幽踪藏绝顶，扳陟独余堪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24423,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]